{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Sarek_vulkan.Vulkan_api_stream</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek-vulkan","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Sarek_vulkan","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Vulkan_api_stream","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Streams (specs/vulkan-async-launches.md).</p><p>A launch is appended to the stream's open command buffer and returns (<a href=\"../Vulkan_api_batch/index.html#val-record_dispatch\"><code>Vulkan_api_batch.record_dispatch</code></a>). The buffer is submitted, not waited for, when it holds <a href=\"#val-batch_limit\"><code>batch_limit</code></a> dispatches, when another stream of the device launches, and at any synchronisation point. The host blocks at <a href=\"#val-synchronize\"><code>synchronize</code></a>, at <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html#val-drain_pending\"><code>Vulkan_api_device.drain_pending</code></a> (host access to device memory, device wait, kernel eviction, device destroy) and when a command buffer is reused. A stream has two command buffers, so one can be recorded while the other runs.</p><p>All streams of a device submit to one queue, in launch order, because a launch first submits the open batches of the device's other streams; dispatches are ordered in memory by barriers (<a href=\"../Vulkan_api_barrier/index.html\"><code>Vulkan_api_barrier</code></a>).</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Device\"><a href=\"#module-Device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> Device</span><span> = <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html\">Vulkan_api_device</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-stream\">Vulkan_api_slot.stream</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-device\"><a href=\"#val-device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> device : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html#type-t\">Sarek_vulkan.Vulkan_api_slot.Device.t</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-batch_limit\"><a href=\"#val-batch_limit\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> batch_limit : <span>int <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.ref</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-max_deferred_bytes\"><a href=\"#val-max_deferred_bytes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> max_deferred_bytes : <span>int <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.ref</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-record_dispatch\"><a href=\"#val-record_dispatch\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> record_dispatch : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-stream\">Vulkan_api_slot.stream</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">kernel</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">layout</span>:<a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_descriptor_set_layout\">Vulkan_types.vk_descriptor_set_layout</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">descriptors</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">record</span>:\u000A    <span>(<span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_command_buffer\">Vulkan_types.vk_command_buffer</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A      <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_descriptor_set\">Vulkan_types.vk_descriptor_set</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A      unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-flush_device\"><a href=\"#val-flush_device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> flush_device : <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html#type-t\">Sarek_vulkan.Vulkan_api_batch.Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-synchronize\"><a href=\"#val-synchronize\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> synchronize : <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-stream\">Vulkan_api_slot.stream</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-add_awaited\"><a href=\"#val-add_awaited\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> add_awaited : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-stream\">Vulkan_api_slot.stream</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-awaited_event\">Vulkan_api_slot.awaited_event</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pending_launches\"><a href=\"#val-pending_launches\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pending_launches : <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html#type-t\">Sarek_vulkan.Vulkan_api_batch.Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-create\"><a href=\"#val-create\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> create : <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html#type-t\">Sarek_vulkan.Vulkan_api_slot.Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-stream\">Vulkan_api_slot.stream</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-forget_default\"><a href=\"#val-forget_default\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> forget_default : <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-stream\">Vulkan_api_slot.stream</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-destroy\"><a href=\"#val-destroy\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> destroy : <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-stream\">Vulkan_api_slot.stream</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Nothing is unregistered if the wait for pending work raises: the stream stays reachable and intact.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-default\"><a href=\"#val-default\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> default : <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html#type-t\">Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_slot/index.html#type-stream\">Vulkan_api_slot.stream</a></span></code></div></div>"}